---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SECTIONS } from '../site.config';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面不存在" noindex>
  <div class="wrap notfound">
    <h1>404</h1>
    <p>这个地址没有对应的页面。可能是文章还没发布，或者链接打错了。</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/">回首页</a></li>
      {SECTIONS.map((s) => <li><a href={`/${s.key}/`}>{s.title}</a></li>)}
      <li><a href="/archive/">全部文章</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .notfound {
    padding-block: 5rem 3rem;
  }

  .notfound h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .notfound p {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .notfound ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
</style>
